Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 22:43:38 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1142/1179] The server log read while it runs: full height,
 Follow let go by a scroll up (1166, part twenty-one)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 04.10.2026: «В консоль Server log добавь пожалуйста, когда уже распахнуто до этого
состояния, кнопочку полной распашки консоли на всю высоту, и чекбокс автопрокрутки по дефолту, —
не возможно во время активности прокрутить и глянуть, что до этого».

The unfolded dock's ⤢ gives the log the window's full height, from under the bar to the player
(⤡ back; kept as chosen; asked while folded, it unfolds). Follow stays on by default; a scroll up by
hand (the wheel, a key, the scroll bar, a finger) lets go of it: it unticks and the log stays where
you read; back at the newest line it ticks again. While you read, the lines under your eye stay
put: the oldest go only past five times the count, and the view moves back by what went. The same
in Engine's log. The button's words in the seven languages.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
